  "created": "2026-10-12T23:59:18.277Z",
  "description": "Turns Scrapy.Net crawls into AI-ready knowledge: article and metadata extraction (OpenGraph, JSON-LD), text normalization, chunking, SimHash near-duplicate detection, content change detection and incremental re-crawls, local hashing embeddings or OpenAI-compatible embeddings, an in-memory SIMD vector store (plus Qdrant, pgvector and Azure AI Search), Microsoft.Extensions.AI adapters (IChatClient, IEmbeddingGenerator), extractive and LLM summarization, keyword/Naive Bayes/LLM categorization, and a RAG ingestion pipeline with a queryable knowledge base. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios, dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
